Package: mscc-volume-gui
Version: 1.0.3
Section: hamradio
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Multus SDR / MSCC Linux <local@localhost>
Depends: python3, python3-tk, pulseaudio-utils | pipewire-pulse
Recommends: mscc, pipewire-pulse | pulseaudio
Homepage: https://local/mscc
Description: MSCC Pulse/PipeWire volume GUI for Raspberry Pi OS
 Tk GUI to set levels for MSCC digi VirtualA/B and operator speaker/mic
 devices from $HOME/.local/mscc ini files. Saves sticky levels to
 volume-levels.conf (restored on mscc start / mscc-virtual-audio).
 .
 Menu: MSCC Volume. CLI: mscc-volume-gui / mscc-volume-restore.
 Also installs under $HOME/mscc/mscc-volume-gui for the installing user.
 .
 Run as your normal desktop user (not root).
